     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I found a solution by myself which may be useful for others. I decreased the size of the panel in which the table is visible bij imposing a smaller width of this panel. See the code below<div><br></div><div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>library(shiny)</div><div>res &lt;- data.frame(1,2,3)</div><div>runApp(list(</div><div>  ui = fluidPage(</div></div></div>"
